(text "The internal converter charges only its own reservoir. U9 on the sensor-power sheet ramps sensor loads separately.\n100 nF boost soft-start; 1 uF IN bypass plus 22 uF bulk. Feedback is sensed BEFORE the output eFuse.\n13k / 33 nF compensation and the 3.3 uH inductor are retained. Converter output is nominally 12.003 V." (at 15 257 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df76f2ad-d32e-5a2e-a288-7b550a54d630"))
(embedded_fonts no))
